<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Amalfi Coast Journey – 10 Days / 10 Nights | Luxury Amalfi Coast Tour</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Explore our luxury 10-day Amalfi Coast tour itinerary. Experience authentic Italian culture, curated activities, and unforgettable moments on the Amalfi Coast.">
    <meta name="keywords" content="Amalfi Coast Tour, Luxury Amalfi Coast Tour, Amalfi Coast itinerary, 10-day Amalfi trip, luxury Italy travel, Amalfi Coast journey, Tocca Amalfi">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="amalfi-journey.css">
    <style>
        .back-to-signature {
            position: fixed;
            top: 20px;
            left: 20px;
            background: #4A9A92;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(74, 154, 146, 0.3);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            z-index: 1000;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }
        
        .back-to-signature:hover {
            background: #3a7a72;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(74, 154, 146, 0.4);
        }
        
        .back-to-signature i {
            font-size: 1rem;
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .back-to-signature {
                top: 10px;
                left: 10px;
                padding: 10px 18px;
                font-size: 0.85rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0-beta3/css/all.min.css" media="print" onload="this.media='all'">
    <noscript><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0-beta3/css/all.min.css"></noscript>
</head>
<body>
    <!-- Back to Signature Journey Button -->
    <a href="the_signature_journey.html" class="back-to-signature">
        <i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i>
        <span>Back to Signature Journey</span>
    </a>
    
    <!-- Hero Header Section - Day 1 -->
    <header class="hero">
        <img src="imagenes/day1.jpeg" alt="Departure" class="hero-image">
        <div class="hero-overlay">
            <div class="hero-icon">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <path d="M21 16v-2l-8-5V3.5c0-.83-.67-1.5-1.5-1.5S10 2.67 10 3.5V9l-8 5v2l8-2.5V19l-2 1.5V22l3.5-1 3.5 1v-1.5L13 19v-5.5l8 2.5z"/>
                </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="hero-badge">LOUNGE DEPARTURE</span>
            <h1 class="hero-title"> Departure</h1>
            <p class="hero-description">Your Italian escape begins! Board your flight and get ready to immerse yourself in the sun-kissed beauty of the Amalfi Coast.</p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Days Grid Section -->
    <section class="days-grid">

        <!-- Day 2 -->
        <article class="day-card white">
            <div class="card-left">
                <div class="card-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                        <rect x="3" y="7" width="18" height="13" rx="2"/>
                        <path d="M7 7V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="card-title">Day 1 – Arrival & Welcome</h3>
                <p class="card-description">Arrive in Naples, where a private driver whisks you along the stunning coastal road. In the evening, gather for a welcome cocktail and dinner on a panoramic terrace.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card-right">
                <span class="image-badge">OFFICIAL PREFACE</span>
                <img src="imagenes/day2.jpeg" alt="Arrival" loading="lazy">
                <div class="image-label">Day 1 – Arrival</div>
            </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Day 3 -->
        <article class="day-card yellow">
            <div class="card-left">
                <div class="card-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                        <path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="card-title">Day 2 – Flavors of the Coast</h3>
                <p class="card-description">A slow morning to rest and explore. In the afternoon, roll up your sleeves for a hands-on cooking class on a cliffside terrace — your first real taste of the Amalfi way of life.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card-right">
                <span class="image-badge">COOKING CLASS</span>
                <img src="imagenesparapaginas/cookingclass.jpeg" alt="Cooking" loading="lazy">
                <div class="image-label">Day 2 – Cooking Class</div>
            </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Day 4 -->
        <article class="day-card white">
            <div class="card-left">
                <div class="card-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                        <path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 00-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 00-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 000-7.78z"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="card-title">Day 3 – Pompeii & Pizza</h3>
                <p class="card-description">Step back in time with a guided trip to ancient Pompeii. Evening: head to Tramonti, birthplace of master pizzaioli, for a traditional pizza-making dinner.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card-right">
                <span class="image-badge">AFFLORED REDUCTIONS</span>
                <img src="imagenes/day4.jpeg" alt="Hotel" loading="lazy">
                <div class="image-label">Day 3 – Pompeii</div>
            </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Day 5 -->
        <article class="day-card cyan">
            <div class="card-left">
                <div class="card-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                        <path d="M21 16v-2l-8-5V3.5c0-.83-.67-1.5-1.5-1.5S10 2.67 10 3.5V9l-8 5v2l8-2.5V19l-2 1.5V22l3.5-1 3.5 1v-1.5L13 19v-5.5l8 2.5z"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="card-title">Day 4 – Enchanting Capri</h3>
                <p class="card-description">Sail to the legendary island of Capri. Explore the Blue Grotto, shop elegant boutiques, and enjoy a seaside swim. Linger for a romantic dinner savoring fresh seafood and island wines.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card-right">
                <span class="image-badge">EVENTUAL ACTIVITIES</span>
                <img src="imagenes/day5.jpeg" alt="Events" loading="lazy">
                <div class="image-label">Day 4 – Capri</div>
            </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Day 8 -->
        <article class="day-card coral">
            <div class="card-left">
                <div class="card-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                        <path d="M12 2C8.5 2 6 4.5 6 8c0 5.25 6 12 6 12s6-6.75 6-12c0-3.5-2.5-6-6-6zm0 8.5c-1.4 0-2.5-1.1-2.5-2.5S10.6 5.5 12 5.5s2.5 1.1 2.5 2.5-1.1 2.5-2.5 2.5z"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="card-title">Day 5 – Positano's Magic</h3>
                <p class="card-description">Head to Positano, with its pastel houses cascading into the sea. Meet a local artisan for a ceramic-painting experience. End the day with a candlelit dinner by the beach.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card-right">
                <span class="image-badge">COASTAL PLANS</span>
                <img src="imagenes/day6.jpeg" alt="Plants" loading="lazy">
                <div class="image-label">Day 5 – Positano</div>
            </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Day 9 -->
        <article class="day-card lightgreen">
            <div class="card-left">
                <div class="card-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                        <path d="M3 13h8V3H3v10zm0 8h8v-6H3v6zm10 0h8V11h-8v10zm0-18v6h8V3h-8z"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="card-title">Day 6 – The Heart of Amalfi</h3>
                <p class="card-description">Spend the day in Amalfi town, visiting the grand cathedral. Join a lemon grove trip, learning about the region's prized sfusato lemons. Taste limoncello and lemon-infused treats.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card-right">
                <span class="image-badge">NATURE TRIPS</span>
                <img src="imagenes/day7.jpeg" alt="Coast" loading="lazy">
                <div class="image-label">Day 6 – Amalfi</div>
            </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Day 8 -->
        <article class="day-card white">
            <div class="card-left">
                <div class="card-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                        <path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm0 18c-4.41 0-8-3.59-8-8s3.59-8 8-8 8 3.59 8 8-3.59 8-8 8z"/>
                        <path d="M15.5 11c.83 0 1.5-.67 1.5-1.5S16.33 8 15.5 8 14 8.67 14 9.5s.67 1.5 1.5 1.5zm-7 0c.83 0 1.5-.67 1.5-1.5S9.33 8 8.5 8 7 8.67 7 9.5 7.67 11 8.5 11zm3.5 6.5c2.33 0 4.31-1.46 5.11-3.5H6.89c.8 2.04 2.78 3.5 5.11 3.5z"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="card-title">Day 7 – La Dolce Far Niente</h3>
                <p class="card-description">A full free day to enjoy as you wish — lounge by the beach, indulge in a spa treatment, or wander the village piazzas.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card-right">
                <span class="image-badge">FREE DAY</span>
                <img src="imagenes/day8.jpeg" alt="Free Day" loading="lazy">
                <div class="image-label">Day 7 – Free Day</div>
            </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Day 9 -->
        <article class="day-card purple">
            <div class="card-left">
                <div class="card-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                        <rect x="3" y="7" width="18" height="13" rx="2"/>
                        <path d="M7 7V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="card-title">Day 8 – Ravello's Romance</h3>
                <p class="card-description">Ascend to Ravello, a jewel suspended between sea and sky. Stroll the gardens of Villa Rufolo or Villa Cimbrone, with views that inspired Wagner. Enjoy a refined dinner in Ravello.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card-right">
                <span class="image-badge">GARDEN VIEWS</span>
                <img src="imagenes/day9.jpeg" alt="Ravello" loading="lazy">
                <div class="image-label">Day 8 – Ravello</div>
            </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Day 10 -->
        <article class="day-card lightgreen">
            <div class="card-left">
                <div class="card-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                        <path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="card-title">Day 9 – Wines of the Hills</h3>
                <p class="card-description">A full-day immersion in the vineyards of Tramonti. Wander between vines, learn the art of local winemaking, and enjoy a rustic wine-pairing lunch. Return for a farewell toast under the stars.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card-right">
                <span class="image-badge">VINEYARD TRIP</span>
                <img src="imagenes/day11.jpeg" alt="Vineyard" loading="lazy">
                <div class="image-label">Day 9 – Vineyard</div>
            </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Day 11 -->
        <article class="day-card coral">
            <div class="card-left">
                <div class="card-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                        <path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm0 18c-4.41 0-8-3.59-8-8s3.59-8 8-8 8 3.59 8 8-3.59 8-8 8z"/>
                        <path d="M15.5 11c.83 0 1.5-.67 1.5-1.5S16.33 8 15.5 8 14 8.67 14 9.5s.67 1.5 1.5 1.5zm-7 0c.83 0 1.5-.67 1.5-1.5S9.33 8 8.5 8 7 8.67 7 9.5 7.67 11 8.5 11zm3.5 6.5c2.33 0 4.31-1.46 5.11-3.5H6.89c.8 2.04 2.78 3.5 5.11 3.5z"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="card-title">Day 10 – Arrivederci</h3>
                <p class="card-description">A bittersweet farewell. After breakfast, transfer to Naples Airport, carrying memories, flavors, and friendships that will last a lifetime. Until we meet again on the Amalfi Coast.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card-right">
                <span class="image-badge">FAREWELL</span>
                <img src="imagenes/day10.jpeg" alt="Amalfi Coast View" loading="lazy">
                <div class="image-label">Day 10 – Arrivederci</div>
            </div>
        </article>

    </section>

